{"step_index":417,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:11:18Z","input_tokens":2364,"cache_read_tokens":198341,"output_tokens":18676,"thinking":"The C# compiler is readily available. Initial hypothesis: crafting the executable entirely in native C# is possible. Proceeding with this approach.\n\n\nGenerating a standalone, optimized C# executable (.exe) seems feasible. The goal is a fast-executing, native C# program without PowerShell dependencies, potentially leading to faster startup and USB scanning speeds. Initial tests indicate a startup time of 0.02 seconds, promising ultra-fast native C# process execution. This approach eliminates potential issues related to PowerShell execution policies and encoding, offering a cleaner, more efficient solution.\n\n\nIncorporating the application icon and assembly metadata is essential for a professional look and feel. The C# program, `PROGRAMA_PERFECTO_XVIEW_B866V2.exe`, will be compiled with the icon and complete assembly details, mimicking a standard Windows executable. The focus remains on strictly adhering to all user rules, ensuring a completely external unlocking process without any physical alterations or prohibited actions as described in the specified rule set.\n\n\nReal-time USB device detection is implemented to handle various states including `WorldCup`, `Fastbootd`, `U-Boot Fastboot`, and direct ADB connections using WMI, system utilities, and `fastboot`. A native C# loop polls a utility to disable the hardware watchdog. Upon detecting `WorldCup` state, a specific sequence of commands is executed via `fastboot`, including flashing images and setting environment variables to unlock the device.\n\n\nThe device state logic is expanded to include `Recovery fastbootd` (PID_4EE7) and `U-Boot Fastboot` (PID_0D02) states. Upon detecting `U-Boot Fastboot`, the program silently runs the unlock sequence, then verifies the unlocked status. If the device is unlocked, an action menu is presented with options for full Android 12 flashing, injecting vbmeta and recovery, or leaving the device in fastboot, all while maintaining a keep-alive to prevent watchdog timeouts. If locked, a rapid \"WorldCup Hunt\" option is presented.\n\n\nExpanding device state detection to include ADB (PID_4EE2 or LAN :5555). When ADB is active, a payload is injected, properties set for OEM/U-Boot unlocking, and bloatware/lock packages disabled. Default launcher, button mapper accessibility, and Stealth ADB mode will be enabled.\n\nAdding options for full Android 12 flashing that includes `boot.img`, `_aml_dtb`, `dtbo.img`, `logo.img`, `param.img`, `conf.img`, `oem.img`, `super.img`, `vbmeta.img`, `recovery.img`, and `cache_ext4.img`, erases userdata, and reboots, but strictly omits the factory and cri_data images.\n\n\nThe program will list APK files, offering individual or batch installation via an install option. A `WorldCup` hunter with manual scan and reset functionality is included, monitoring a specific USB vendor ID. USB drive detection and decryption of ZTE logs using a native C# substitution cipher are implemented, along with a driver installation option and the ability to connect via IP. The C# source file and custom icon will be generated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"using System;\nusing System.Collections.Generic;\nusing System.Diagnostics;\nusing System.IO;\nusing System.Linq;\nusing System.Management;\nusing System.Reflection;\nusing System.Text;\nusing System.Text.RegularExpressions;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\n\n[assembly: AssemblyTitle(\"PROGRAMA PERFECTO - MEGACABLE XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2)\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyDescription(\"Motor Nativo de Salto Directo y Liberacion Externa para ZTE ZXV10 B866V2\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyConfiguration(\"\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyCompany(\"Xview+ B866V2 Tools\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyProduct(\"PROGRAMA PERFECTO XVIEW+ B866V2\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyCopyright(\"Copyright (C) 2026\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyVersion(\"2.0.0.0\")]\n[assembly: AssemblyFileVersion(\"2.0.0.0\")]\n\nnamespace ProgramaPerfectoB866V2\n{\n    public class ToolResult\n    {\n        public bool TimedOut { get; set; }\n        public int ExitCode { get; set; }\n        public string Output { get; set; }\n    }\n\n    public class BoxConnectionState\n    {\n        public string UsbHardwareMode { get; set; }\n        public string SerialNumber { get; set; }\n        public string RawPid { get; set; }\n        public bool FastbootLive { get; set; }\n        public List<string> AdbDevices { get; set; }\n        public List<string> FastbootDevices { get; set; }\n\n        public BoxConnectionState()\n        {\n            UsbHardwareMode = \"Ninguno detectado por cable USB directo\";\n            SerialNumber = \"No detectado\";\n            RawPid = \"\";\n            FastbootLive = false;\n            AdbDevices = new List<string>();\n            FastbootDevices = new List<string>();\n        }\n    }\n\n    class Program\n    {\n        static string ROOT_DIR;\n        static string MOTOR_DIR;\n        static string APKS_DIR;\n        static string KEYS_DIR;\n        static string DRV_DIR;\n        static string FW_DIR;\n\n        static string ADB_EXE;\n        static string FASTBOOT_EXE;\n        static string ADNL_EXE;\n        static string UPDATE_EXE;\n        static string ENV_UNL_IMG;\n        static string CONF_IMG;\n\n        static string CONNECTED_IP = \"\";\n\n        static int Main(string[] args)\n        {\n            try\n            {\n                Console.OutputEncoding = Encoding.UTF8;\n                Console.Title = \"PROGRAMA PERFECTO - MEGACABLE XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2) [EJECUTABLE NATIVO .EXE]\";\n            }\n            catch { }\n\n            string exePath = Assembly.GetExecutingAssembly().Location;\n            string exeDir = Path.GetDirectoryName(exePath);\n\n            // Soportar ejecucion desde la raiz de 'programa perfecto' o desde '1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR'\n            if (Directory.Exists(Path.Combine(exeDir, \"1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\")))\n            {\n                ROOT_DIR = exeDir;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ROOT_DIR = Path.GetDirectoryName(exeDir);\n            }\n\n            MOTOR_DIR = Path.Combine(ROOT_DIR, \"1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\");\n            APKS_DIR  = Path.Combine(ROOT_DIR, \"2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV\");\n            KEYS_DIR  = Path.Combine(ROOT_DIR, \"3_LLAVES_USB_PARA_LA_CAJA\");\n            DRV_DIR   = Path.Combine(ROOT_DIR, \"4_DRIVERS_Y_GUI_WINDOWS\");\n            FW_DIR    = Path.Combine(ROOT_DIR, \"5_FIRMWARE_SEGURO_B866V2\");\n\n            ADB_EXE      = Path.Combine(MOTOR_DIR, \"adb.exe\");\n            FASTBOOT_EXE = Path.Combine(MOTOR_DIR, \"fastboot_moderno.exe\");\n            if (!File.Exists(FASTBOOT_EXE))\n            {\n                FASTBOOT_EXE = Path.Combine(MOTOR_DIR, \"fastboot.exe\");\n            }\n            ADNL_EXE     = Path.Combine(MOTOR_DIR, \"adnl.exe\");\n            UPDATE_EXE   = Path.Combine(MOTOR_DIR, \"update.exe\");\n            ENV_UNL_IMG  = Path.Combine(FW_DIR, \"env_unlocked.img\");\n            CONF_IMG     = Path.Combine(FW_DIR, \"conf.img\");\n\n            if (args != null && args.Any(a => a.Equals(\"--check\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)))\n            {\n                ShowBanner();\n                PrintMenuOptions();\n                return 0;\n            }\n\n            while (true)\n            {\n                ShowBanner();\n                PrintMenuOptions();\n                WriteColor(\"Selecciona el numero de la opcion [0-7]: \", ConsoleColor.Yellow, false);\n                string choice = Console.ReadLine();\n                if (choice == null) break;\n                choice = choice.Trim();\n\n                switch (choice)\n                {\n                    case \"0\":\n                        ConnectAdbTarget();\n                        break;\n                    case \"1\":\n                        InvokeAutoMultiChannelJump();\n                        break;\n                    case \"2\":\n                        InvokeSafeAndroid12Flash(false);\n                        break;\n                    case \"3\":\n                        InvokeAppInstallerMenu();\n                        break;\n                    case \"4\":\n                        InvokeAmlogicWorldCupEngine();\n                        break;\n                    case \"5\":\n                        InvokeUsbPrepAndLogDecrypt();\n                        break;\n                    case \"6\":\n                        InvokeDriversAndGuiMenu();\n                        break;\n                    case \"7\":\n                        return 0;\n                    default:\n                        Thread.Sleep(300);\n                        break;\n                }\n            }\n            return 0;\n        }\n\n        static void PrintMenuOptions()\n        {\n            WriteColor(\"  [1] SALTO AUTOMATICO MULTI-CANAL (Caza WorldCup InUsbBurn 48ms -> Desbloquea env_unlocked.img\", ConsoleColor.Green);\n            WriteColor(\"      -> Salta a Fastboot PID_0D02 desbloqueado / Recovery PID_4EE7 / ADB Directo)\", ConsoleColor.Green);\n            WriteColor(\"  [2] FLASHEO SEGURO ANDROID 12 LIBERADO (B866V2) Conservando Widevine L1 y MAC\", ConsoleColor.Magenta);\n            WriteColor(\"      (Retiene la caja en Fastboot con Keep-Alive y protege factory + cri_data)\", ConsoleColor.Magenta);\n            WriteColor(\"  [3] Instalador de Apps de TV y Entretenimiento (MagisTV, Xuper, Hdplay, Launchers)\", ConsoleColor.White);\n            WriteColor(\"  [4] Motor Amlogic DNL / WorldCup (adnl.exe + update.exe por boton externo RESET)\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            WriteColor(\"  [5] Preparar Memoria USB (QADEBUG.ini + factory_update_param.aml) y Descifrar Logs\", ConsoleColor.Yellow);\n            WriteColor(\"  [6] Instalar Drivers USB (WorldCup VID_1B8E) o Abrir ADB AppControl GUI\", ConsoleColor.White);\n            WriteColor(\"  [0] Conectar por IP Local o Refrescar Radar USB   |   [7] Salir\", ConsoleColor.DarkGray);\n            WriteColor(\"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\", ConsoleColor.DarkCyan);\n        }\n\n        static void WriteColor(string text, ConsoleColor color, bool newLine = true)\n        {\n            ConsoleColor prev = Console.ForegroundColor;\n            Console.ForegroundColor = color;\n            if (newLine) Console.WriteLine(text);\n            else Console.Write(text);\n            Console.ForegroundColor = prev;\n        }\n\n        static ToolResult InvokeToolSafe(string exePath, string argString, int timeoutMs = 3000)\n        {\n            if (!File.Exists(exePath))\n            {\n                return new ToolResult { TimedOut = false, ExitCode = -1, Output = \"[NO_EXE]\" };\n            }\n            try\n            {\n                ProcessStartInfo psi = new ProcessStartInfo\n                {\n                    FileName = exePath,\n                    Arguments = argString,\n                    WorkingDirectory = MOTOR_DIR,\n                    RedirectStandardOutput = true,\n                    RedirectStandardError = true,\n                    UseShellExecute = false,\n                    CreateNoWindow = true\n                };\n\n                using (Process proc = new Process())\n                {\n                    proc.StartInfo = psi;\n                    proc.Start();\n\n                    Task<string> outTask = proc.StandardOutput.ReadToEndAsync();\n                    Task<string> errTask = proc.StandardError.ReadToEndAsync();\n\n                    if (!proc.WaitForExit(timeoutMs))\n                    {\n                        try { proc.Kill(); } catch { }\n                        return new ToolResult { TimedOut = true, ExitCode = -1, Output = \"[TIMEOUT]\" };\n                    }\n\n                    outTask.Wait(200);\n                    errTask.Wait(200);\n                    string oStr = outTask.IsCompleted ? outTask.Result : \"\";\n                    string eStr = errTask.IsCompleted ? errTask.Result : \"\";\n                    string combined = (oStr + \"\\n\" + eStr).Trim();\n                    return new ToolResult { TimedOut = false, ExitCode = proc.ExitCode, Output = combined };\n                }\n            }\n            catch (Exception ex)\n            {\n                return new ToolResult { TimedOut = false, ExitCode = -1, Output = ex.Message };\n            }\n        }\n\n        static int InvokeToolInteractive(string exePath, string argString)\n        {\n            if (!File.Exists(exePath)) return -1;\n            try\n            {\n                ProcessStartInfo psi = new ProcessStartInfo\n                {\n                    FileName = exePath,\n                    Arguments = argString,\n                    WorkingDirectory = MOTOR_DIR,\n                    UseShellExecute = false\n                };\n                using (Process proc = Process.Start(psi))\n                {\n                    proc.WaitForExit();\n                    return proc.ExitCode;\n                }\n            }\n            catch\n            {\n                return -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        static ToolResult InvokeFastbootSafe(string argString, int timeoutMs = 3000)\n        {\n            return InvokeToolSafe(FASTBOOT_EXE, argString, timeoutMs);\n        }\n\n        static ToolResult InvokeUpdateSafe(string argString, int timeoutMs = 5000)\n        {\n            return InvokeToolSafe(UPDATE_EXE, argString, timeoutMs);\n        }\n\n        static ToolResult InvokeAdbSafe(string argString, int timeoutMs = 10000)\n        {\n            string prefix = string.IsNullOrEmpty(CONNECTED_IP) ? \"\" : (\"-s \" + CONNECTED_IP + \" \");\n            return InvokeToolSafe(ADB_EXE, prefix + argString, timeoutMs);\n        }\n\n        static int InvokeAdbInteractive(string argString)\n        {\n            string prefix = string.IsNullOrEmpty(CONNECTED_IP) ? \"\" : (\"-s \" + CONNECTED_IP + \" \");\n            return InvokeToolInteractive(ADB_EXE, prefix + argString);\n        }\n\n        static string ReadChoiceWithKeepAlive(string promptText, string[] validChoices)\n        {\n            WriteColor(promptText + \" (\" + string.Join(\"/\", validChoices) + \"): \", ConsoleColor.Yellow, false);\n            DateTime lastPulse = DateTime.Now;\n            while (true)\n            {\n                if (Console.KeyAvailable)\n                {\n                    ConsoleKeyInfo keyInfo = Console.ReadKey(true);\n                    string ch = keyInfo.KeyChar.ToString().ToUpperInvariant();\n                    if (validChoices.Contains(ch))\n                    {\n                        WriteColor(ch, ConsoleColor.Green);\n                        return ch;\n                    }\n                }\n                if ((DateTime.Now - lastPulse).TotalSeconds >= 2.0)\n                {\n                    lastPulse = DateTime.Now;\n                    InvokeFastbootSafe(\"getvar version-bootloader\", 1200);\n                }\n                Thread.Sleep(60);\n            }\n        }\n\n        static bool TryCatchWorldCup48ms()\n        {\n            if (!File.Exists(UPDATE_EXE)) return false;\n            ToolResult res = InvokeUpdateSafe(\"bulkcmd \\\"watchdog off\\\"\", 1500);\n            if (!res.TimedOut &&\n                res.Output.IndexOf(\"No [WorldCup Device]\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0 &&\n                res.Output.IndexOf(\"can not find device\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0 &&\n                res.Output.IndexOf(\"ERR(\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0)\n            {\n                Console.WriteLine();\n                WriteColor(\"[+] Detectada caja en Modo Amlogic WorldCup / InUsbBurn (VID_1B8E) en <50ms!\", ConsoleColor.Green);\n                WriteColor(\"    [1/4] Watchdog de 14s apagado exitosamente.\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n\n                if (File.Exists(ENV_UNL_IMG))\n                {\n                    WriteColor(\"    [2/4] Inyectando particion 'env' desbloqueada (env_unlocked.img -> lock=10100000, otg_device=1)...\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n                    ToolResult rEnv = InvokeUpdateSafe(\"partition env \\\"\" + ENV_UNL_IMG + \"\\\"\", 8000);\n                    WriteColor(\"          Resultado env: \" + rEnv.Output.Replace(\"\\r\", \" \").Replace(\"\\n\", \" \"), ConsoleColor.Gray);\n                }\n                if (File.Exists(CONF_IMG))\n                {\n                    InvokeUpdateSafe(\"partition conf \\\"\" + CONF_IMG + \"\\\"\", 6000);\n                }\n\n                WriteColor(\"    [3/4] Grabando variables U-Boot (lock=10100000, unlock_ability=1, otg_device=1)...\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n                string[] cmds = new string[]\n                {\n                    \"setenv -f lock 10100000\",\n                    \"setenv lock 10100000\",\n                    \"setenv unlock_ability 1\",\n                    \"setenv otg_device 1\",\n                    \"saveenv\"\n                };\n                foreach (string c in cmds)\n                {\n                    InvokeUpdateSafe(\"bulkcmd \\\"\" + c + \"\\\"\", 3000);\n                }\n\n                WriteColor(\"    [4/4] Saltando la caja a U-Boot Fastboot DESBLOQUEADO (PID_0D02)...\", ConsoleColor.Green);\n                InvokeUpdateSafe(\"bulkcmd \\\"fastboot\\\"\", 3000);\n                Thread.Sleep(1200);\n                return true;\n            }\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        static BoxConnectionState GetBoxConnectionState()\n        {\n            BoxConnectionState state = new BoxConnectionState();\n\n            // 1. Prueba directa WorldCup (48ms)\n            ToolResult wcCheck = InvokeUpdateSafe(\"bulkcmd \\\"watchdog off\\\"\", 1000);\n            if (!wcCheck.TimedOut &&\n                wcCheck.Output.IndexOf(\"No [WorldCup Device]\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0 &&\n                wcCheck.Output.IndexOf(\"can not find device\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0 &&\n                wcCheck.Output.IndexOf(\"ERR(\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) < 0)\n            {\n                state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Amlogic WorldCup / InUsbBurn Activo (VID_1B8E) - LISTO PARA DESBLOQUEO\";\n                state.RawPid = \"1B8E\";\n            }\n\n            // 2. Escaneo WMI PnP\n            try\n            {\n                using (ManagementObjectSearcher searcher = new ManagementObjectSearcher(\n                    \"SELECT DeviceID FROM Win32_PnPEntity WHERE DeviceID LIKE '%VID_18D1%' OR DeviceID LIKE '%VID_19D2%' OR DeviceID LIKE '%VID_1B8E%'\"))\n                {\n                    foreach (ManagementObject dev in searcher.Get())\n                    {\n                        string devId = Convert.ToString(dev[\"DeviceID\"]) ?? \"\";\n                        int lastSlash = devId.LastIndexOf('\\\\');\n                        if (lastSlash >= 0 && lastSlash + 1 < devId.Length)\n                        {\n                            string sn = devId.Substring(lastSlash + 1);\n                            if (!sn.Contains(\"&\")) state.SerialNumber = sn;\n                        }\n\n                        if (devId.IndexOf(\"PID_4EE2\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0)\n                        {\n                            state.UsbHardwareMode = \"ADB USB Activo (PID_4EE2) - LISTO PARA LIBERACION DIRECTA\";\n                            state.RawPid = \"4EE2\";\n                        }\n                        else if (devId.IndexOf(\"PID_4EE7\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0)\n                        {\n                            state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Recovery Fastbootd (PID_4EE7) - ACTIVO\";\n                            state.RawPid = \"4EE7\";\n                        }\n                        else if (devId.IndexOf(\"PID_0D02\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0)\n                        {\n                            state.RawPid = \"0D02\";\n                        }\n                        else if (devId.IndexOf(\"PID_4EE1\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0)\n                        {\n                            state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Modo MTP Android (PID_4EE1) - Usa Opcion 1 para Salto Automatico\";\n                            state.RawPid = \"4EE1\";\n                        }\n                        else if (devId.IndexOf(\"VID_1B8E\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0)\n                        {\n                            state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Amlogic WorldCup / DNL Mode (VID_1B8E) - LISTO PARA DESBLOQUEO U-BOOT\";\n                            state.RawPid = \"1B8E\";\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            catch { }\n\n            // 3. Verificar ADB\n            if (File.Exists(ADB_EXE))\n            {\n                ToolResult adbRes = InvokeToolSafe(ADB_EXE, \"devices\", 2000);\n                if (!adbRes.TimedOut)\n                {\n                    foreach (string rawLine in adbRes.Output.Split(new[] { '\\r', '\\n' }, StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries))\n                    {\n                        Match m = Regex.Match(rawLine.Trim(), @\"^(\\S+)\\s+(device|unauthorized|offline)$\");\n                        if (m.Success)\n                        {\n                            state.AdbDevices.Add(m.Groups[1].Value + \" [\" + m.Groups[2].Value + \"]\");\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // 4. Verificar Fastboot y filtrar descriptores fantasma\n            if (File.Exists(FASTBOOT_EXE))\n            {\n                ToolResult fbRes = InvokeFastbootSafe(\"devices\", 1500);\n                if (!fbRes.TimedOut)\n                {\n                    foreach (string rawLine in fbRes.Output.Split(new[] { '\\r', '\\n' }, StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries))\n                    {\n                        Match m = Regex.Match(rawLine.Trim(), @\"^(\\S+)\\s+fastboot\");\n                        if (m.Success)\n                        {\n                            string candidateSn = m.Groups[1].Value;\n                            ToolResult ping = InvokeFastbootSafe(\"getvar version-bootloader\", 900);\n                            if (!ping.TimedOut && (\n                                ping.Output.IndexOf(\"version-bootloader\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0 ||\n                                ping.Output.IndexOf(\"OKAY\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0 ||\n                                ping.Output.IndexOf(\"Finished\", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) >= 0))\n                            {\n                                state.FastbootDevices.Add(candidateSn);\n                                state.FastbootLive = true;\n                                if (state.RawPid == \"0D02\")\n                                {\n                                    state.UsbHardwareMode = \"U-Boot Fastboot Activo (PID_0D02) - RESPONDIENDO EN VIVO\";\n                                }\n                            }\n                            else\n                            {\n                                if (state.RawPid == \"0D02\")\n                                {\n                                    state.UsbHardwareMode = \"Caja encendida en Android (Descriptor Fastboot previo en reposo)\";\n                                    state.RawPid = \"0D02_GHOST\";\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            return state;\n        }\n\n        static void ShowBanner()\n        {\n            try { Console.Clear(); } catch { }\n            WriteColor(\"================================================================================\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            WriteColor(\"          PROGRAMA PERFECTO - MEGACABLE XVIEW+ (ZTE ZXV10 B866V2) [.EXE]        \", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            WriteColor(\"     Motor de Salto Directo (WorldCup 48ms / Fastbootd / Fastboot / ADB)        \", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            WriteColor(\"      Regla: 100% Externo Sin Abrir Tornillos | Proteccion Widevine L1/MAC      \", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            WriteColor(\"================================================================================\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n\n            BoxConnectionState st = GetBoxConnectionState();\n            Console.WriteLine();\n            WriteColor(\" [RADAR DE HARDWARE USB EN TIEMPO REAL]\", ConsoleColor.Yellow);\n            WriteColor(\"  * Caja Detectada   : Xview+ (Serie: \" + st.SerialNumber + \")\", ConsoleColor.White);\n\n            if (st.RawPid == \"4EE2\" || st.RawPid == \"0D02\" || st.RawPid == \"4EE7\" || st.RawPid == \"1B8E\")\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Estado Cable USB : \" + st.UsbHardwareMode, ConsoleColor.Green);\n            }\n            else if (st.RawPid == \"4EE1\" || st.RawPid == \"0D02_GHOST\")\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Estado Cable USB : \" + st.UsbHardwareMode, ConsoleColor.Yellow);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Estado Cable USB : \" + st.UsbHardwareMode, ConsoleColor.Gray);\n            }\n\n            if (st.AdbDevices.Count > 0)\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Sesion ADB       : \" + string.Join(\", \", st.AdbDevices), ConsoleColor.Green);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Sesion ADB       : Sin sesion activa\", ConsoleColor.DarkGray);\n            }\n\n            if (st.FastbootLive && st.FastbootDevices.Count > 0)\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Sesion Fastboot  : ACTIVA EN VIVO (\" + string.Join(\", \", st.FastbootDevices) + \")\", ConsoleColor.Green);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                WriteColor(\"  * Sesion Fastboot  : En espera de salto (Opcion 1 caza WorldCup/Fastboot)\", ConsoleColor.DarkGray);\n            }\n            WriteColor(\"--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\", ConsoleColor.DarkCyan);\n        }\n\n        static void ExecuteAdbPayload()\n        {\n            Console.WriteLine();\n            WriteColor(\"[1/7] Inyectando token 'EE@' en /cache/recovery/last_QR (Bypass candado QR ZTE)...\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            InvokeAdbSafe(\"shell \\\"echo -n 'EE@' > /cache/recovery/last_QR; rm -f /cache/recovery/last_QR_Time\\\"\");\n\n            WriteColor(\"[2/7] Desbloqueando banderas OEM y U-Boot (lock=10100000, otg_device=1) desde ADB...\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            InvokeAdbSafe(\"shell \\\"settings put global oem_unlock_enabled 1; settings put secure oem_unlock_enabled 1\\\"\");\n            InvokeAdbSafe(\"shell \\\"setprop ubootenv.var.lock 10100000; setprop ubootenv.var.otg_device 1; setprop persist.sys.usb.config mtp,adb\\\"\");\n            InvokeAdbSafe(\"shell \\\"settings put global package_verifier_user_consent -1; settings put global package_verifier_enable 0; bmgr enable false\\\"\");\n\n            WriteColor(\"[3/7] Instalando Launchers Offline y Utilidades desde '2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV'...\", ConsoleColor.Cyan);\n            string[,] coreApks = new string[,]\n            {\n                { \"Home_Screen_Launcher_1.1.3.apk\", \"Home Screen Launcher (Ligero)\" },\n                { \"TVLauncher_4_GoogleTV.apk\",      \"TVLauncher 4 (Estilo Google TV)\" },\n                { \"Button_Mapper_Pro_2.54.apk\",     \"Button Mapper Pro v2.54 (Reasignar Boton Home)\" },\n                { \"autostart.apk\",                  \"AutoStart al encender\" }